# Phase Balance Summary

| Phase | Focus | Main work packages |
|-------|--------|---------------------|
| **1** | Operational pipeline (AWS) | Contract, Ingestion (TypeScript), SNS/SQS, Aggregator (Go), DynamoDB, **gRPC API**, AWS Terraform, basic observability, CI |
| **2** | Cross-cloud, analytics, **UI first slice** | Forwarder, Pub/Sub, Analytics, BigQuery, GCP Terraform, **user_interface/** (Elixir/Phoenix LiveView, Aggregator gRPC client, list + detail), CI for GCP and UI |
| **3** | **Commit–reveal + eligibility** | Merkle registry, commit/reveal contract, Aggregator gRPC for UI, ADRs 0001–0003, **self-audit workshop** (learning) |
| **4** | Event backbone, **UI full slice**, production | Kafka/MSK (opt.), schema registry (opt.), **UI streaming + Analytics gRPC + voter activity**, Grafana, alerting, E2E tests, load/runbooks, OIDC/security |
| **5** | **Playground & simulation** | Primitive **voting UI** (create proposal, vote on chain); **configurable orchestrator** (chain mode; injection mode optional); playground runbook; observe full pipeline and dashboards |

Each phase delivers a **shippable slice**. Phase 5 delivers a **playable** system: you can trigger real or simulated votes and watch activity everywhere (read UI, Grafana, BigQuery, queues) without hand-crafting events.

