# CI/CD Roadmap (cross-phase)

Authoritative decision: **ADR 0004** (`docs/ADR/0004-ci-cd-github-actions.md`). Implementation checklist: `docs/planning/ci_cd_roadmap.md`.

## Do immediately — Phase A (next session, priority)

| Item | Deliverable | Blocks |
|------|-------------|--------|
| Unified workflow | `.github/workflows/ci.yml` | Partial Phase 1 exit criterion; contributor confidence |
| Format gate | `npm run format:check` (`scripts/format-all.sh`) | Style drift on merge |
| TypeScript | Ingestion + `tools/**` npm test/build | Regressions in event adapter and admin tooling |
| Go | `services/aggregator` `go test ./...` | Projection/handler regressions |
| Rust | `voting-crypto` tests + `cargo fmt --check` | Crypto/helper regressions |
| Terraform | fmt + validate `infra/aws`, `infra/gcp` on **`main`** | Broken IaC merges |
| Cleanup | Remove duplicate workflows after green run | CI minute waste, confusion |

**Not in Phase A:** `anchor test`, audit jobs, `terraform plan`, deploy, E2E.

