| `anchor-test` job | Solana + Anchor in GitHub runner | Runner setup cost; devnet runbook should be stable first |
| `audit-deps` job | `npm run audit`, govulncheck, cargo audit policy | Mostly dev-deps noise until triage (`deferred_dependency_audit_and_ci.md`) |
| `terraform-plan` | Read-only plan per root module | Needs cloud credentials or OIDC read role |
| Path filter tuning | Narrow/noisy jobs | Informed by first month of PRs |

